{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00552","headline":"郊庙歌辞 禅社首乐章 灵具醉 · 贺知章、源乾曜","name":"郊庙歌辞 禅社首乐章 灵具醉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵具醉，杳熙熙。\n灵将往，眇禗禗。\n顾明德，吐正辞。\n烂遗光，流祯祺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺知章、源乾曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}